      "text": "GET   /                           health\nGET   /api/branches               multi-branch\nGET   /api/user/:telegramUserId   upsert + points\nGET   /api/catalog                sold-out only\nPUT   /api/catalog/:id/sold-out   staff\nPOST  /api/orders                 the only write\nGET   /api/orders?branchId=       staff poll\nGET   /api/orders/user/:tgUserId  customer poll\nPUT   /api/orders/:id/status      staff\nPOST  /api/payment/khqr           MOCK",
