    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "gap1",
      "x": 60, "y": 2760, "width": 620, "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "#fecaca",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 800010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800011,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "gap1_t", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "gap1_t",
      "x": 80, "y": 2778, "width": 580, "height": 130,
      "text": "initData signature NEVER validated\n\nPRD §2: \"Validate Telegram's initData\nsignature on the backend.\"\n\nCode: bot.ts only handles /start. Any client\ncan POST as any telegramUserId — and spend\nsomeone else's loyalty points.",
      "originalText": "initData signature NEVER validated\n\nPRD §2: \"Validate Telegram's initData\nsignature on the backend.\"\n\nCode: bot.ts only handles /start. Any client\ncan POST as any telegramUserId — and spend\nsomeone else's loyalty points.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 800012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800013,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "gap1", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "gap2",
      "x": 720, "y": 2760, "width": 620, "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "#fecaca",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 800014, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800015,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "gap2_t", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "gap2_t",
      "x": 740, "y": 2778, "width": 580, "height": 130,
      "text": "Payment is a mock\n\nPRD §2: \"Confirm payment via server-side\nwebhook — never trust client-side success.\"\n\nCode: POST /api/payment/khqr returns a fake\nstring. The client waits 1500ms, then POSTs\nthe order as if it were paid.",
      "originalText": "Payment is a mock\n\nPRD §2: \"Confirm payment via server-side\nwebhook — never trust client-side success.\"\n\nCode: POST /api/payment/khqr returns a fake\nstring. The client waits 1500ms, then POSTs\nthe order as if it were paid.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 800016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800017,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "gap2", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "gap3",
      "x": 1380, "y": 2760, "width": 620, "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "#fecaca",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 800018, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800019,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [{"id": "gap3_t", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "gap3_t",
      "x": 1400, "y": 2778, "width": 580, "height": 130,
      "text": "Totals trusted from the client\n\nPOST /api/orders stores whatever\ntotalAmount arrives — then awards loyalty\npoints on that same number.\n\nThe server never re-prices from\nbasePrice + Σ priceDelta.",
      "originalText": "Totals trusted from the client\n\nPOST /api/orders stores whatever\ntotalAmount arrives — then awards loyalty\npoints on that same number.\n\nThe server never re-prices from\nbasePrice + Σ priceDelta.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 800020, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 800021,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "gap3", "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "gap4",
      "x": 2040, "y": 2760, "width": 620, "height": 180,
